license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Preliminary and unrefereed code and certificate for the proposed composite
  lower bound c_E > 0.3805603. The central two bins are checked by a new
  C/MPFR verifier; 170 outer bins rely on SHA-256-pinned upstream Arb reports.
  Parseval energy constraints are prior work; the claimed contribution is
  their finite profile-space prefix projection and its use in the two binding
  bins. No claim is Lean-verified or independently reproduced.
